.TH PSSigmoidDerivativeS 3 2023-12-07 "PsyC 0.9.3" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
PSSigmoidDerivativeS

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/activation.h>

.I
PSFloat  
.br
\fBPSSigmoidDerivativeS\fR(\fIPSFloat val\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Computes derivative for sigmoid activation function (\fIPSSigmoidS\fR).
.br
This function applies to scalar values, so it takes the scalar \fIval\fR as argument and returns a \fIPFloat\fR scalar.
.br
The equivalent function to be used with vectors/matrices is \fIPSSigmoidDerivative\fR.  

.SH RETURN VALUES
ReLU derivative scalar result.

.SH SEE ALSO
PSSigmoidDerivative(3), PSSigmoidS(3)
